# argument                         |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .....................................................................................................
input                              |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
output                             |   string       |  mandatory  |  valor_recoselection_minidst_shweta.root
sample                             |   string       |  mandatory  |  numuCCIncl
oscillation                        |   string       |  optional   |  numu-disappearance
disable-checks                     |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
mesg-thresholds                    |   string       |  optional   |  verbosity.xml
beam                               |   string       |  optional   |  BNB_FHC
write-universes,no-write-universes |   boolean_list |  optional   |  no-write-universes
apply-weights, dont-apply-weights  |   boolean_list |  optional   |  apply-weights
no-truth                           |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
other-sample                       |   boolean      |  optional   |  false
fix-nonres,keep-nonres             |   boolean_list |  optional   |  fix-nonres
status-code-set,no-status-code     |   boolean_list |  optional   |  status-code-set
max-n-events                       |   integer      |  optional   |  -1